5,0,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. Let us approach this trial with calm hearts and open minds.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minako,,Agreed. We need to be logical to find the werewolf. Let's observe each other's behavior carefully.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,George,,I will be watching. It is best to stay composed and not rush into any conclusions.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Asuka,,I agree with Minako. Logic is our only tool here. I'll be analyzing the patterns of our conversation.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm going to find the werewolf first! This is going to be so much fun!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Your enthusiasm is refreshing, Sakura. However, remember that patience is often the key to uncovering the truth.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minako,,Does anyone have a strategy they would like to propose for the first few days?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,George,,I prefer to listen for now. The first few words often reveal more than the planned ones.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"I think we should look for contradictions. If someone's story changes, they are likely the werewolf or the possessed.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,I'll look for funny clues! Maybe the werewolf will sneeze or something! Hehe!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"A gentle reminder to everyone: trust is a fragile thing, but it is the only bridge to our victory.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minako,,"Trust is important, but verification is essential. I will be focusing on the consistency of everyone's claims.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,George,,I'll keep to myself for a bit. I find it easier to judge when I am not the center of attention.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"@George, being too distant can sometimes be seen as suspicious. I suggest you engage more.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"@George, don't be shy! Come play with us!","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,Let us enter the first night with peace in our souls. May the truth reveal itself to us.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Minako,,I am ready. Let's see what the first day brings.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,George,,I have seen enough for today.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Asuka,,I will spend the night reflecting on these initial interactions.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,4,talk,Sakura,,I wonder who the Seer is! I bet I can guess! Goodnight everyone!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
