32,1,1,talk,Servas,,Good morning. I hope you all rested well. The atmosphere feels heavy today; let us stay positive.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I have information. Servas, you are the werewolf.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,George,,"That is a bold claim to make so early, Minako. Are you the Seer?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"If Minako is the Seer, the logic is simple: we execute Servas. But we must confirm her role.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"What?! Servas is the bad guy? But he's so nice! Are you sure, Minako?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Servas,,"My dear Minako, I am saddened that you see me this way. I assure you, I am but a humble human.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Minako,,I am the Seer. My divination does not lie. Servas is the werewolf.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,George,,It is possible the werewolf is claiming to be the Seer to frame an innocent man.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@George, that is a possibility. However, if Minako is the werewolf, she is taking a huge risk by claiming Seer on day one.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""George"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"This is getting exciting! But Servas is so sweet, I can't believe it!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Servas,,It is a tragedy when words are twisted. I only wish for the safety of this village.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Minako,,Emotional appeals will not change the fact. I saw the truth last night.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,George,,"I still find it a bit abrupt. But if we trust the Seer, the game ends now.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Asuka,,The most logical move is to trust the Seer's direct result unless there is a counter-claim. Is anyone else the Seer?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm not the Seer! I just want to find the mystery!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Servas,,"If my departure is what you believe is necessary for peace, I accept your judgment with a smile.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Minako,,I am certain. Let us vote.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,George,,Very well. I will follow the majority.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I vote for Servas based on the Seer's evidence.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'm still sad, but if Minako says so, then okay!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
